From b07382c5ada8d8729ca2dd360359157230d248c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:05:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add ecdsa_mp::derive_mul_add_ac (local key derivation on
 threshold shares, C and C++ API)

Derives key * mul + add on an access-structure key share without interaction:
every party maps its share x_i to mul * x_i + add and every public share Qi to
mul * Qi + add * G. Valid only for a single THRESHOLD gate (Shamir sharing),
where any quorum's Lagrange coefficients sum to one. Used for BOLT 3
per-commitment keys (mul = 1) and revocation keys.

Written with AI assistance (Claude).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FEFPxoVaygFeJXwvZUffGz
